    {
        "id": "en:word:structure-such-as",
        "label": "such as",
        "fields": {
            "part_of_speech": "preposition",
            "pronunciation": ["/sʌtʃ əz/"],
            "audio": "audio/ab111273c42034bf7ab55273a293a9d1db93ca24c9db63bfc8ca865d5a709b37.wav",
            "reference_images": [
                "images/16c8fbb233a591083cc6b1834f76406841538d7bef76636c670154144cfd1b5a.jpg"
            ],
            "usage_notes": {
                "en": "Such as introduces examples within a category. Example: I like fruit such as apples and bananas. Apples and bananas are examples of fruit, not a complete list.",
                "de": "Such as führt Beispiele für eine Kategorie ein. „I like fruit such as apples and bananas.“ = Ich mag Obst wie Äpfel und Bananen. Das sind Beispiele, keine vollständige Liste.",
                "id": "Such as memperkenalkan contoh dalam suatu kategori. “I like fruit such as apples and bananas.” = Saya suka buah seperti apel dan pisang. Apel dan pisang adalah contoh buah, bukan daftar lengkap.",
                "ja": "such asはカテゴリーの例を挙げます。「I like fruit such as apples and bananas.」＝私はリンゴやバナナなどの果物が好きです。リンゴとバナナは例で、全種類の一覧ではありません。"
            }
        },
        "class": "lexical:preposition",
        "tags": ["preposition", "sentence-structure", "grammar"],
