    {
        "id": "en:word:structure-for-example",
        "label": "for example",
        "fields": {
            "part_of_speech": "adverb",
            "pronunciation": ["/fər ɪɡˈzɑːmpəl/"],
            "audio": "audio/16ce3c1022bd495f470534e1f73e94bfa891c7c41075b4f27928c9ed2b746b36.wav",
            "reference_images": [
                "images/e5d8f72e4e6658ef1f3151b4008b31e72d1a9cebc29c310dd5867d262654f3fd.jpg"
            ],
            "usage_notes": {
                "en": "For example introduces an illustration of a general statement. Example: Flowers have different colours. For example, this flower is red. The singled-out flower represents one example.",
                "de": "For example führt ein Beispiel für eine allgemeine Aussage ein. „Flowers have different colours. For example, this flower is red.“ = Blumen haben verschiedene Farben. Zum Beispiel ist diese Blume rot. Die hervorgehobene Blume steht für ein einzelnes Beispiel.",
                "id": "For example memperkenalkan contoh dari pernyataan umum. “Flowers have different colours. For example, this flower is red.” = Bunga memiliki berbagai warna. Misalnya, bunga ini berwarna merah. Bunga yang ditunjuk mewakili satu contoh.",
                "ja": "for exampleは一般的な説明に例を添えます。「Flowers have different colours. For example, this flower is red.」＝花にはいろいろな色があります。例えば、この花は赤いです。指さされた花は一例を表します。"
            }
        },
        "class": "lexical:adverb",
        "tags": ["adverb", "sentence-structure", "grammar"],
